      69.84,
      383.28,
      310.0,
      429.35
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act No. 28 of 1964 (Amendment) that theGovernment intends to acquire the following land/servitudewhich is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      78.96,
      442.08,
      287.44,
      452.15
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or servitude to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      464.16,
      310.11,
      549.35
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land in total extent of about 0.0659 Hectaredepicted as Lot No. 01 in the Preliminary Plan No. 4053, dated19.06.2017 prepared by the Survey General situated in theVillage called Ginthota in Adhikari Pattuwa Minor Division inthe Divisional Secretary's Division of Mahara in GampahaDistrict of the Western Province and more fully described asfollows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      171.6,
      564.24,
      208.45,
      574.31
    ],
